      "en": "After him Gabbai and Sallai, nine hundred twenty-eight.",
      "ko": "그 다음은 갑배와 살래 등이니 도합이 구백 이십 팔명이라",
      "source_text_hash": "0ef112b241eaaa9792bfc5dac722c6b5ed12b57c23834a249f4b5e9582be7137",
      "translation_text_hash": "b026715b52c0968434c6d015cc406221206deff4e76bdf12fa82be1199211194",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
